# "At the beginning of your end step" abilities trigger only as an end step begins (CR 500.6); a turn ended with Sundial of the
# Infinite before its end step has none (CR 724.1e, the ruling: "Those abilities will trigger at the beginning of the end step
# of the next turn"). Bot1 ends its turn 3 in the first main phase: Oblivious Bookworm asks nothing that turn (the refusal), and
# asks at the beginning of Bot1's turn 5 end step - the positive control - where Bot1 draws and discards.

